; One variable: a Label with FILL, autowrap off and a trimming text_overrun_behavior. Label::_shape fits
; the line, trims it justification-aware, then fits it again with JUSTIFICATION_CONSTRAIN_ELLIPSIS
; (label.cpp:322-325), so the spaces of the kept glyphs grow until the ellipsis ends at the box edge.
; Box widths 200-310 run the cut across several word positions; behaviour 3 is TRIM_ELLIPSIS, 4 is
; TRIM_WORD_ELLIPSIS, and 1 is TRIM_CHAR, which adds no ellipsis and so shows a second fit that
; leaves the box edge alone.

